        "raw": "<p>Stealth Bot says &quot;Allies adjacent to Stealth Bot gain cover&quot;. Does this have any consequences other than that said allies will not be in line of sight to someone who is not adjacent to them?</p><p>In particular, would such allies block line of sight by creating cover on their space?</p>",
