      {
        "id": 115982,
        "name": "kseanking",
        "username": "kseanking",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/46a35a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-22T18:45:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would take this to mean that allies adjacent to stealth bot are only targettable by someone who is adjacent to them. I don't think that it alters the map in any way (ie creates cover on the hex,) it just puts the person on the hex \"into cover,\" therefore not blocking line of sight through the hex.</p><p>That's just my take on it though.</p>",
