        "created_at": "2014-08-22T20:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If Tachyon and Blade are adjacent, cover or not, they have LoS to eachother</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, I understood it that if you are adjacent to someone in cover, you can see them regardless of elevation. So basically the cover is disregarded for that attack when you are adjacent to someone.</p>",
